        "Id" : "event_mw_humble",
        "Name" : "Humble Pie",
        "Details" : "While walking through the MechBay, you notice one of your elite pilots, [[TGT_MW,{TGT_MW.Callsign}]], working shoulder-to-shoulder with the lowliest tech assistants, covered in dirt and helping dust-mop down the Mech Bay floor after an hour of using compressed air guns to blow trapped dirt from a series of battlemech legs.\r\n\r\nYou never noticed the change in them until now. It's almost like they lost the chip on their shoulder overnight.",
